  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have been given that&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>93</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>w</mi></math>&nbsp;is the order of the matrix.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>16</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>80</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>80</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>80</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>96</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
